    "review.nuance-dragon.nuance.dragon.medical.is.the": "Nuance Dragon Medical is the industry-leading AI-powered speech recognition platform designed specifically for healthcare professionals. Acquired by Microsoft in 2022, Nuance has pioneered medical voice recognition technology since 1997, serving over 500,000 clinicians worldwide across 10,000+ healthcare facilities. Dragon Medical combines advanced deep learning algorithms with specialized medical vocabularies to deliver 99% accuracy in clinical documentation, enabling physicians to create complete, accurate medical records three times faster than typing.",
    "review.nuance-dragon.what.distinguishes.dragon.medical.from": "What distinguishes Dragon Medical from generic speech recognition is its deep understanding of medical terminology, clinical workflows, and healthcare-specific documentation requirements. The platform recognizes over 500,000 medical terms spanning all specialties, adapts to individual physician speaking patterns and vocabulary preferences, and integrates seamlessly with major electronic medical record (EMR) systems. Physicians can dictate directly into their EMR, create reports, order medications, and navigate clinical applications entirely by voice, dramatically reducing documentation time and improving clinical efficiency.",
